{"unit_id":"fuyue521__dsh-desktop-shortcut#feature-1","repo":"fuyue521/dsh-desktop-shortcut","commit":"6bd601ca32a6faba617fc57b34c77892138a5279","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-shortcut 的功能「桌面启动入口」：Windows 启动插件时生成 DeepSeek Harness 快捷方式；双击后运行配置的 dsh 命令并打开本地网页。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:79-90","lib/index.js:303-312","lib/index.js:316-326"]}
