{"unit_id":"fuyue521__dsh-desktop-shortcut#feature-3","repo":"fuyue521/dsh-desktop-shortcut","commit":"6bd601ca32a6faba617fc57b34c77892138a5279","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-shortcut 的功能「悬浮刷新控件」：网页中注册可拖动按钮，点击后刷新页面并显示成功反馈，同时把按钮位置保存在浏览器本地存储。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:91-99","lib/client.js:118-122","lib/client.js:185-200","lib/client.js:292-301"]}
{"unit_id":"fuyue521__dsh-desktop-shortcut#feature-4","repo":"fuyue521/dsh-desktop-shortcut","commit":"6bd601ca32a6faba617fc57b34c77892138a5279","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-shortcut 的功能「生成期间禁用刷新」：按钮读取当前会话的运行状态；AI 正在生成时显示相应状态并禁用按钮，避免此时触发刷新。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:113-116","lib/client.js:224-230","lib/client.js:254-267"]}
